        "TileImage": "$($repository ee2af034-8ebe-43f8-a8f3-525e060dbb31).Image",
        "Description": "You, a mercenary, are hired to eliminate 5 men who are disguising as staff members in the race event. What is their crime? Assassinating a Politician who supports Equality between Furries. Now, the assassins are on the run and they are blending in well without anyone suspecting them. Some abandoned their weapons to avoid traces, but you found their crumbs. Get them without leaving any traces to the public. Make sure that you are&apos;t being put up on the Wanted Poster",
